WEBVTT

00:02:56.680 --> 00:03:03.070
if you disagree, it becomes 
your responsibility to prove otherwise.

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:04.070
Right?

00:03:06.088 --> 00:03:08.558
Ah, I’ve gotten ahead of myself.

00:03:08.558 --> 00:03:11.098
You’ll see what I mean soon enough.

00:03:11.098 --> 00:03:15.727
Anyway, your legal system 
supposedly recognizes this rule—

00:03:15.727 --> 00:03:18.477
so what are you all doing here?

00:03:25.318 --> 00:03:28.298
"It’s July 17th, 1950,

00:03:28.298 --> 00:03:33.070
and the senate subcommittee has officially
dismissed all charges against Kenyon."